\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E8-MJMAIN-33\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E8-MJMAIN-2C\" x=\"500\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E8-MJMAIN-35\" x=\"945\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E8-MJMAIN-2C\" x=\"1446\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E8-MJMAIN-37\" x=\"1891\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E8-MJMAIN-2C\" x=\"2391\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E8-MJMAIN-39\" x=\"2836\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span>), and there are <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.162ex\" height=\"2.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 500.5 936.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-9-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-9-Title\">4</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E9-MJMAIN-34\" d=\"M462 0Q444 3 333 3Q217 3 199 0H190V46H221Q241 46 248 46T265 48T279 53T286 61Q287 63 287 115V165H28V211L179 442Q332 674 334 675Q336 677 355 677H373L379 671V211H471V165H379V114Q379 73 379 66T385 54Q393 47 442 46H471V0H462ZM293 211V545L74 212L183 211H293Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E9-MJMAIN-34\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> suits in total. So, we have\n<span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"26.432ex\" height=\"5.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -1.838ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -1437.2 11380.6 2228.5\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-10-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-10-Title\">\nP(O) = \\dfrac{4\\cdot 4}{52} =\\dfrac{16}{52} = \\dfrac{4}{13}.\n</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\"